  {
   "id": null,
   "label": "1. Introduction",
   "fields": [
    {
     "id": null,
     "type": 6,
     "text": "<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"691\" id=\"isPasted\">This form is used to collect the practical information Kinder Minds needs to set up and manage care for the Client/Patient. This includes contact details, information to support communication with GPs or schools (where relevant), billing details, and identifying a primary contact for routine administration.</p><p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"857\">This form <strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"731\">does not provide consent</strong> for assessment or treatment: all consent decisions are handled separately in the <strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"856\">Combined Consent and Information Form</strong> which you will have been sent alongside this form.</p>",
     "label": "Form Purpose",
     "options": [],
     "currentValue": null,
     "isMultiple": false,
     "mode": null,
     "isScoreEnabled": null,
     "checked": false,
     "activeDrawing": null,
     "selectedDrawing": null,
     "annotations": [],
     "rules": null,
     "profileFieldType": "None",
     "customFieldTemplateId": null,
     "dataUrl": null,
     "files": []
    },
    {
     "id": null,
     "type": 6,
     "text": "<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"934\" id=\"isPasted\">Regardless of who provides consent, tis registration form may be completed by either:</p><ul data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1111\"><li data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1059\"><p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1059\">the Client/Patient themselves (where they are an adult or a young person able to give informed consent for themselves), or</p></li><li data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1111\"><p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1111\">a parent or legal guardian of the Client/Patient.</p></li></ul><div><br></div><div>Please continue onto Section 2</div>",
     "label": "Who Can Complete This Form",
     "options": [],
     "currentValue": null,
     "isMultiple": false,
     "mode": null,
     "isScoreEnabled": null,
     "checked": false,
     "activeDrawing": null,
     "selectedDrawing": null,
