  {
   "id": null,
   "label": "3. Contact Details",
   "fields": [
    {
     "id": null,
     "type": 6,
     "text": "<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"397\" id=\"isPasted\">This section identifies the <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"351\">Primary Contact</strong> for routine communication and administration as well as all other important contact details such for Parents / Legal Guardians and for the young Client.</p><div><br></div><p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"579\">The Primary Contact is the person Kinder Minds will usually communicate with about matters such as appointment scheduling, reminders, follow-up administration, and billing queries. The Primary Contact may be:</p><ul data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"696\"><li data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"644\"><p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"644\">the Client/Patient themselves, and / or</p></li><li data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"696\"><p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"696\">a Parent / Legal Guardian of the Client.</p></li></ul><div><br></div><p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"1003\">Where a Client under 18 is able to give informed consent for themselves, they are usually the Primary Contact unless they request otherwise.</p><p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"1003\"><br data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"841\">Where a Client under 18 requires guardian consent, the Primary Contact is typically the parent/legal guardian who engages Kinder Minds or who is identified below.</p><div><br></div><p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1224\">Identifying a Primary Contact helps ensure clear and efficient communication. It does not limit the legal rights of the Client or any Parent / Legal Guardian to access information or be involved in care, where applicable.</p>",
     "label": null,
     "options": [],
     "currentValue": null,
     "isMultiple": false,
     "mode": null,
     "isScoreEnabled": null,
     "checked": false,
     "activeDrawing": null,
     "selectedDrawing": null,
     "annotations": [],
     "rules": null,
     "profileFieldType": "None",
     "customFieldTemplateId": null,
     "dataUrl": null,
     "files": []
    }
   ]
  },
