     "text": "<div><strong>We Are a Southern Cross Registered Provider</strong></div><div id=\"isPasted\">As a Southern Cross Registered Provider <strong>we are able to process claims on your behalf upon completion of services&nbsp;</strong>saving you the hassle. If you would like us to assist with managing your claim please feel free to let us know your Southern Cross details below and we will process your billing accordingly.</div><div><br></div><div>When we process a claim this way we will only charge you for the difference (if any) between your billed amount and your policy covered amount. We will advise you of any claim outcome when we process payment.<br><strong><br>Your Southern Cross Details</strong></div><div id=\"isPasted\">To process your Southern Cross Claim for you all we need is either your policy number or your Southern Cross Membership Card Number (which starts with 6101). Please let us know either and we'll be able to take it from there.</div>",
